{"id":"6cc7683da507f845e066159cc289412e1a86090f","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56644","title":"AI+NLP博士论文 | UC Berkeley 2026 | 减轻训练后效应对语言模型生成多样性的影响 135页 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"图科学实验室Graph Science Lab\n                  2026-07-26 16:30 分享","excerpt":"大型语言模型虽能生成高质量答案，但在输出多样性方面存在明显不足，难以在多解场景下提供独特、有效的多样化响应，这限制了其在对抗测试、搜索及合成数据生成等关键领域的应用。本文首先强调提升语言模型多样性的重要性和紧迫性，继而提出并介绍SimpleStra方法，旨在系统性增强模型的多样化生成能力，为解决该问题提供新思路与技术路径。（150字）","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"post-content\" data-v-633d9142=\"\"><html><head></head><body><div id=\"js_content\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"图科学实验室Graph Science Lab\" data-alias=\"Graph_Science_Lab\" data-from=\"0\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2YZ1GHcDiaaLrod7BicMicB8ZxzJTEDXEHjEfeAnwSLK3I8ldIia9dQ3CeHY0jz78tyapw3R77wIM6weQD4XnJhJGg/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"分享有关图理论、图表示学习、图神经网络、图+交叉学科（生物、化学、物理 ...）、图+交叉算法（DL、RL、NLP、CV ...）最新的科研资讯、论文、开源工具、招生/招聘、会议/竞赛、课程/书籍。欢迎持续关注。\" data-id=\"MzU4NTQyNjc5Mg==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\"></mp-common-profile></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/05949da86dd837934768eda023ddfb1a1785054607532.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"100008943\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/05949da86dd837934768eda023ddfb1a1785054607532.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">大型语言模型（</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Large language models,&#160;</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">LLM）</span>在生成连贯、高质量的答案方面已经取得了显著的成就。然而，它们在生成<span textstyle=\"\">多样化（</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">diverse</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">）</span>的输出方面往往存在困难，尤其是在存在多个同样合理的答案时。这种局限性在对抗测试、搜索和合成数据生成等领域尤为关键，因为在这些领域，生成独特且有效的答案至关重要。本文首先探讨了解决语言模型多样性问题的迫切性。随后，我将介绍 SimpleStrat，这是一种轻量级方法，它利用模型自身自动对解空间进行分层。通过执行<span textstyle=\"\">分层采样（</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">stratified sampling</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">）</span>，我们可以在不牺牲质量的前提下提高多样性和覆盖率。我还将描述如何使用 CoverageQA 来衡量重采样多样性，并讨论这些思想如何扩展到创造性和开放式任务。为了将这些思想扩展到权重空间，我将讨论 Stylus，它通过利用适配器合并来生成更高质量的图像，同时通过随机化适配器子集进行合并来获得有意义的多样性，从而在质量和多样性之间取得平衡。论文最后将探讨如何超越多样性，关注创造力，以及在运用LLM发现新颖创意作品方面所面临的挑战。任何人都可以评论杰作，但创作杰作的艺术家却永垂不朽。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f743436949fb65c52cde59f288e486521785054607532.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.4148148148148147\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014402\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f743436949fb65c52cde59f288e486521785054607532.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100014403\" data-ratio=\"1.2944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2d2a293f212f78ba89c59b1b47f416b51785054607532.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2d2a293f212f78ba89c59b1b47f416b51785054607532.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">论文题目<span textstyle=\"\">：</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">Mitigating Post-Training Effects on Generative Diversity in Language Models</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">作者</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：</span><span><span leaf=\"\">Justin Wong</span></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">类型：</span></strong><span><span leaf=\"\">2026年博士论文</span></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">学校：</span></strong><span><span leaf=\"\">University of California, Berkeley</span></span><span><span leaf=\"\">（美国加州大学伯克利分校</span></span><span><span leaf=\"\">）</span></span></p><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><b><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">下载论文</span></span></SPAN></b><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">https://t.zsxq.com/mypgT</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></SPAN></section><p data-pm-slice=\"2 6 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">请索引第144篇博士论文</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f360a7f9ac469cf37a72e8af83bdd3481785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.537962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014406\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f360a7f9ac469cf37a72e8af83bdd3481785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9fbb364c1a7dedc368ed391620a4b1bd1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42777777777777776\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014407\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9fbb364c1a7dedc368ed391620a4b1bd1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6c0558b3e44fe40bfbce8d32579dd36e1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7555555555555555\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014408\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6c0558b3e44fe40bfbce8d32579dd36e1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/275191eb33213bb51240a55920a067cf1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4824074074074074\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014409\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/275191eb33213bb51240a55920a067cf1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f1516b786066c781146b1406f36ec90d1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.524074074074074\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014410\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f1516b786066c781146b1406f36ec90d1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cc844a1ba45f8cf3aa6bfd8e2c8a62fe1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.38425925925925924\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014411\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cc844a1ba45f8cf3aa6bfd8e2c8a62fe1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b468c3efc4eeb78011643a794e4f99f61785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4537037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014412\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b468c3efc4eeb78011643a794e4f99f61785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/94114fa085c33d8de4e6ed5cfeedb8e71785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.2944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014404\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/94114fa085c33d8de4e6ed5cfeedb8e71785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d89819a5189cc76cd0c850a0ec91d49b1785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.2944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100014405\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d89819a5189cc76cd0c850a0ec91d49b1785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d133073002ed8977f5a1ab3def91b1401785054607533.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.08055555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d133073002ed8977f5a1ab3def91b1401785054607533.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section><strong><span leaf=\"\">微信群</span></strong></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d08d29a31ae0c2c8eed31c9041b20e181785054607534.webp\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"512\" data-imgfileid=\"100008918\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d08d29a31ae0c2c8eed31c9041b20e181785054607534.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/32d40ade52dd7e0ce37c851e06bdb3e91785054607534.webp\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"430\" data-imgfileid=\"100008919\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/32d40ade52dd7e0ce37c851e06bdb3e91785054607534.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p></div></body></html><p><span>内容中包含的图片若涉及版权问题，请及时与我们联系删除</span></p></div></DIV>","content_text":"大型语言模型（Large language models, LLM）在生成连贯、高质量的答案方面已经取得了显著的成就。然而，它们在生成多样化（diverse）的输出方面往往存在困难，尤其是在存在多个同样合理的答案时。这种局限性在对抗测试、搜索和合成数据生成等领域尤为关键，因为在这些领域，生成独特且有效的答案至关重要。本文首先探讨了解决语言模型多样性问题的迫切性。随后，我将介绍 SimpleStrat，这是一种轻量级方法，它利用模型自身自动对解空间进行分层。通过执行分层采样（stratified sampling），我们可以在不牺牲质量的前提下提高多样性和覆盖率。我还将描述如何使用 CoverageQA 来衡量重采样多样性，并讨论这些思想如何扩展到创造性和开放式任务。为了将这些思想扩展到权重空间，我将讨论 Stylus，它通过利用适配器合并来生成更高质量的图像，同时通过随机化适配器子集进行合并来获得有意义的多样性，从而在质量和多样性之间取得平衡。论文最后将探讨如何超越多样性，关注创造力，以及在运用LLM发现新颖创意作品方面所面临的挑战。任何人都可以评论杰作，但创作杰作的艺术家却永垂不朽。论文题目：Mitigating Post-Training Effects on Generative Diversity in Language Models作者：Justin Wong类型：2026年博士论文学校：University of California, Berkeley（美国加州大学伯克利分校）下载论文：https://t.zsxq.com/mypgT请索引第144篇博士论文微信群内容中包含的图片若涉及版权问题，请及时与我们联系删除","fetched_at":"2026-07-27T09:12:42.623Z","ok":true}